{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/advanced/observability","title":"Observability","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"observability","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Observability"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Because every dependency is resolved through one system, that system is also the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"place to cross-cut them all — logging, timing, correlation ids, snapshots — with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no change to the business code."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" you need to see what your app is doing in production, or to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"connect craft to your monitoring stack."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Start with "},{"t":"code","text":"Console"}]},{"t":"text","text":": it is yieldable, so overriding it once redirects every"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"log in the app."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same DI system that powers "},{"t":"code","text":"craftService"},{"t":"text","text":" also lets you cross-cut every crafted function with side effects — logging, snapshots, correlation tracking, timing, error reporting — without touching the business code."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"mental-model","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Mental Model"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" distinguishes two kinds of failures:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Expected errors"}]},{"t":"text","text":": handled explicitly with "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/app/craft-service","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftException"}]},{"t":"text","text":" in your business code."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Unexpected errors"}]},{"t":"text","text":": bugs. They should never happen — and if they do, they should never happen "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"again"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Unexpected errors are exactly where observability shines. Since they are supposed to be impossible, you want to capture the maximum amount of context the moment one is thrown: stack, app state, correlation chain, etc. That context can then be shipped to a log server, an alerting pipeline, or directly to an AI webhook for triage."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The three pillars "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" exposes for that are:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providefnwrapper","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — wrap every crafted function with cross-cutting behavior"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providetemplatetrace","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTemplateTrace"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — observe effective component and template renders"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providecraftroutertrace","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftRouterTrace"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — observe navigation events and Craft route stages"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providecrafthttptrace","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftHttpTrace"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — wrap every "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftHttpClient"},{"t":"text","text":" request"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/reactivity/streams#observability","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideStreamTrace"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — observe every typed stream subscription; stream handlers also go through "},{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providetakeappsnapshot","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — capture all active state when something goes wrong"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#craft-dom-event-hooks","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftDomEventHook"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — observe or wrap every DOM action declared in a Craft template"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"#providecorrelationidtracking","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCorrelationIdTracking"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — link a user gesture to every async operation it triggered"}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providefnwrapper","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"},{"t":"text","text":" lets you wrap "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"every"}]},{"t":"text","text":" generator-based function executed by "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" (services, methods, async processes, queries, mutations, effects…). It is the single best entry point to add cross-cutting side effects."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Basic use case — log any unexpected error to the console:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftAppConfig, provideFnWrapper, Console } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"appConfig"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAppConfig","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ...","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  providers: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"provideFnWrapper","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"'Warning: dependency injection here is not type-safe and may fail at runtime'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"factory"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"thisArg"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"args"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"try","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" factory.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"apply","kind":"function"},{"text":"(thisArg, args);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"catch","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (error) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"error","kind":"function"},{"text":"(error);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"throw","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" error;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You can register multiple wrappers — they compose. The first registered is the outermost."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providetemplatetrace","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTemplateTrace"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTemplateTrace"},{"t":"text","text":" is the render-specific counterpart to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"},{"t":"text","text":". It runs synchronously around the children produced by an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"effective render, including component templates, reactive updates, blocks,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"projections, deferred branches, and nested callbacks."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideTemplateTrace } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideTemplateTrace","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"start"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"try","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"finally","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"debug","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      context.phase,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      context.componentName,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"-","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" start,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    );","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The context contains the render unit ("},{"t":"code","text":"component"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"block"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"projection"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"deferNode"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"callback"},{"t":"text","text":"), its phase ("},{"t":"code","text":"create"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"initialRender"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"update"},{"t":"text","text":", or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"destroy"},{"t":"text","text":"), the optional component/unit names, and the owning component's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"renderCount"},{"t":"text","text":". Wrappers compose in registration order and execute in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"current render injector, so component-scoped providers remain injectable."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The wrapper can return different children or return an empty children value"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"without calling "},{"t":"code","text":"next()"},{"t":"text","text":" to replace or block a render. Errors propagate to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"normal Craft render error boundary."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providecraftroutertrace","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftRouterTrace"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftRouterTrace"},{"t":"text","text":" traces both the Router event stream and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft outlet's non-blocking route chain. The latter exposes "},{"t":"code","text":"match"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"guard"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and "},{"t":"code","text":"resolve"},{"t":"text","text":" stages, including reactive guard re-evaluation."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideCraftRouterTrace } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideCraftRouterTrace","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"log","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'[router:start]'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", context);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"result"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"log","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'[router:end]'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", context);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" result;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Multiple wrappers compose in registration order. The wrapper must call"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"next()"},{"t":"text","text":" to preserve the navigation or route-chain work."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providecrafthttptrace","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftHttpTrace"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftHttpTrace"},{"t":"text","text":" wraps the actual thenable request produced by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftHttpClient"},{"t":"text","text":", after its method, URL, params, and payload have been built."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"It is therefore useful for timing, request logging, redaction, and error"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reporting without changing feature code."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideCraftHttpTrace } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideCraftHttpTrace","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"start"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"try","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"finally","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"log","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.method, context.url, performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"-","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" start);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"important-injection-inside-providefnwrapper-is-not-type-safe","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Important: injection inside "},{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"},{"t":"text","text":" is not type-safe"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The wrapper body runs in "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the injection context where the error was raised"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not where the wrapper was declared. That makes it extremely practical: you can yield browser boundaries, inject host-tagged metadata, read the offending service's correlation id, etc."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"But it has two consequences:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"injections inside the wrapper are "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not type-safe"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" cannot prove statically that the dependency you ask for is actually provided where the wrapper runs"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the wrapper is therefore a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"risky"}]},{"t":"text","text":" place to do business work"}]}]]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"},{"t":"text","text":" mostly for "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"side effects"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — logging, metrics, snapshots, correlation propagation. Avoid pulling business state through it."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When the wrapped function is an insertion method, the wrapper can inject the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"matching runtime context — "},{"t":"code","text":"injectQueryMethodRuntimeContext()"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"injectStateMethodRuntimeContext()"},{"t":"text","text":", and the siblings for "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":" — and call "},{"t":"code","text":"get"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"set"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"update"},{"t":"text","text":" /"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"patch"},{"t":"text","text":" on the owning primitive. That is how registries, WebMCP tools, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"other advanced patterns seed or replace a query result, a mutation value, a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":", and so on. See"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/primitive-anatomy#injectable-runtime-context","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Anatomy of a primitive"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"example-timing-every-craft-function","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Example: timing every craft function"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftAppConfig, provideFnWrapper, HostTag } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideFnWrapper","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'Warning: dependency injection here is not type-safe and may fail at runtime'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"factory"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"thisArg"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"args"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"start"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"try","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" factory.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"apply","kind":"function"},{"text":"(thisArg, args);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"finally","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"name"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"HostTag","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"log","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"name","kind":"string"},{"text":"} took ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"performance","kind":"function"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"() ","kind":"string"},{"text":"-","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"string"},{"text":"start","kind":"string"},{"text":"}ms`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providetakeappsnapshot","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot"},{"t":"text","text":" captures the list of all "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"active states"}]},{"t":"text","text":" in the app the moment an unexpected error occurs."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is one of the most valuable pieces of context you can ship to a log server or AI webhook: you get not just the stack, but the full picture of what the app was holding when it broke."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftAppConfig, provideTakeAppSnapshot } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"appConfig"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAppConfig","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ...","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  providers: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"reports"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// reports: SnapshotReport[]","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// — one entry per active state, with its source, ancestry, and current value","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"warn","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'App snapshot:'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", reports);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// In production you would forward this to a log server or AI webhook:","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// fetch('/api/incident', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify({ reports }) });","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each "},{"t":"code","text":"SnapshotReport"},{"t":"text","text":" contains:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"source"},{"t":"text","text":" — the source tag of the state"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"from"},{"t":"text","text":" — the ancestry chain that produced it"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" — the actual current value"}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Under the hood, "},{"t":"code","text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot"},{"t":"text","text":" registers its own "},{"t":"code","text":"provideFnWrapper"},{"t":"text","text":" that triggers the snapshot collection whenever an unexpected error bubbles up. CraftTS control-flow throws such as "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftGenShortCircuit"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftNotSettled"},{"t":"text","text":" are deliberately excluded: they are consumed by "},{"t":"code","text":"catchNode"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"pendingNode"},{"t":"text","text":" boundaries during normal rendering. An unhandled boundary error remains observable and still triggers a snapshot. You do not need to call it manually."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"craft-dom-event-hooks","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft DOM event hooks"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every DOM event bound from a Craft template goes through the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DOM_EVENT_HOOK"},{"t":"text","text":" token. Hooks run in the injector of the component that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declared the element, and compose in registration order. A hook must call"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"next()"},{"t":"text","text":" to preserve the component action."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftComponent, button } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideCraftDomEventHook } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"save","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"debug","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'saved'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"SavePanel"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'SavePanel'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    providers: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"provideCraftDomEventHook","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"interaction"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        console.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"debug","kind":"function"},{"text":"(interaction.interactionName, interaction.event);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'save'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { type: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'button'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", click: save }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Save'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The hook receives the native event, its normalized name, the element, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component name, and a descriptive "},{"t":"code","text":"interactionName"},{"t":"text","text":" such as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"SavePanel:button:save:click"},{"t":"text","text":". This is the extension point for analytics,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"authorization, tracing, or correlation IDs. A hook can also stop an action by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not calling "},{"t":"code","text":"next()"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"providecorrelationidtracking","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCorrelationIdTracking"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCorrelationIdTracking"},{"t":"text","text":" ties every async operation back to the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"user gesture"}]},{"t":"text","text":" that triggered it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When a Craft template action runs, a fresh correlation id is generated from its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"location ("},{"t":"code","text":"SavePanel:button:save:click:uuid"},{"t":"text","text":", for example). Navigation back and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"forward still generate "},{"t":"code","text":"nav-back:uuid"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"nav-forward:uuid"},{"t":"text","text":". Every generator"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"invoked downstream — directly or transitively, sync or async — captures that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"id at invocation time."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftAppConfig, provideCorrelationIdTracking } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"appConfig"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAppConfig","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ...","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  providers: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"provideCorrelationIdTracking","kind":"function"},{"text":"()],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Once enabled, the correlation id is attached to the metadata of browser boundaries like "},{"t":"code","text":"Console"},{"t":"text","text":", so a single "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* Console.error(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" carries:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"startCorrelationId"},{"t":"text","text":" — the id captured when the current generator was invoked"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"lastCorrelationId"},{"t":"text","text":" — the most recent id observed in the app"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"mayCorrelatedIds"},{"t":"text","text":" — the chain of ids the operation can be linked to"}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This lets you reconstruct, from logs alone, the full causal chain between "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"user clicked Save\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"the third sub-request returned 500 four seconds later\""}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Combined with "},{"t":"code","text":"provideTakeAppSnapshot"},{"t":"text","text":", you get on every unexpected error:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the stack"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the snapshot of all active states"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the correlation id chain back to the originating user gesture"}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"putting-it-all-together","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Putting It All Together"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Wire all three in your "},{"t":"code","text":"appConfig"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  craftAppConfig,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  Console,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideFnWrapper,","kind":"